      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَغْمَصُ</span></b>  <i>Having, in his eye, what is termed</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمَصٌ</span>, q. v.: (Mgh, K:) or <i>disordered in the eye;
whose eyes are dim,</i> or <i>watery;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْمَشُ</span>: (L
and TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عمش</span>:) fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمْصَآءُ</span>: and pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُمْصٌ</span>.
(TA.)

